# billacode.org is now a redirect, not a site. Every old URL keeps working and
# passes its ranking signals to the .com — which is why the .org registration
# stays renewed rather than being allowed to lapse. Host-qualified sources, so
# these only fire for the old domain and never loop on the new one.
https://billacode.org/*      https://billacode.com/:splat  301
https://www.billacode.org/*  https://billacode.com/:splat  301

# One canonical host on the new domain too.
https://www.billacode.com/*  https://billacode.com/:splat  301

# Legacy routes from the Next.js site. The /blogs/<slug> URLs are unchanged,
# so only the aliases below need forwarding.
/blog                /blogs        301
/blog/*              /blogs/:splat 301
/posts               /blogs        301
/posts/*             /blogs/:splat 301
/cv                  /resume       301
/feed                /rss.xml      301
/feed.xml            /rss.xml      301
